  designNotes: 'Strength Sap (the user, 2026-10-15), kept fair: each Dawn the enemy
    creature facing it loses 1 Attack while it stays in play, and the Vampire heals
    1. Only the one in front of it, so stepping out of its lane stops it; Allergic
    to Light, the Reveal it fears.'
  artDescription: A pale aristocrat in a cape at a blood-donation clinic, sipping
    from a sleeping gym bro's arm through a bendy straw, the bro's bicep visibly
    deflating like a balloon.
